### [MODIFY] [parser_engine.py](file:///c:/Users/Prashant/Documents/NLMongo_Project/nl_to_mongo/parser/parser_engine.py)

New pipeline orchestration:
```python
class NLQueryParser:
    def __init__(self, schema):
        self.resolver = SemanticResolver(schema)
        self.normalizer = TextNormalizer(self.resolver)
        self.lark_parser = Lark(grammar_file, parser="earley")
        self.compiler = MongoCompiler(schema, self.resolver)
    
    def parse(self, nl_query):
        normalized = self.normalizer.normalize(nl_query)
        tree = self.lark_parser.parse(normalized)
        return self.compiler.transform(tree)
```

