| 5 | **Standalone parser generation** | Lark generates standalone [.py](file:///c:/Users/Prashant/Documents/NLMongo_Project/nl_to_mongo/run_server.py) parser — zero runtime deps | Lark standalone |
| 6 | **Cross-language portability** | Lark.js reads same `.lark` grammar — browser-side parsing/validation | Lark.js |
| 7 | **1500+ benchmark tests** | Integrate DocSpider (766) + MongoDB mongosh (766) + SM3 test pairs | DocSpider, mongosh, SM3 |
| 8 | **Hybrid local model path** | Simple queries → Lark; complex/ambiguous → local fine-tuned model → same AST | nl2query |
| 9 | **Query explanation visitor** | `ExplainVisitor` walks AST → English description of what was parsed | C# Lucene visitor |
